  "notes": "Modified cash basis governmental funds (p5 Total Governmental Funds); fund balances 405,224 -> 401,149. Beginning cash not printed (no prior-year balance sheet); ending cash = governmental funds balance sheet cash 398,957 + county treasurer cash 2,192 = total assets 401,149 (p4). Business-type from the accrual proprietary statement p7 (Total), which matches the Statement of Activities business-type column (expenses 654,174 = operating 632,983 + interest 20,161 + loan fees 1,030, p2). Proprietary cash flows from p8-9 Total column. Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position (includes capital assets and debt), component unit excluded. Detail: General Fund from the departmental combining statement (p12-13), which supersedes the General Fund budget schedule (p10); Street Fund from its budget schedule (p11); enterprise funds from the proprietary statement fund columns (no enterprise budget schedules). 'Charges, admission, and rental fees' 4,929 split by the departmental/Street schedules. Read pages 1-13 of 13"
